        {
            "behavior": "none",
            "id": "n970-4",
            "kind": "comment",
            "label": "Our mission is to provide you with reports which you can use to plan and control the routine operations of your business.\n\nWe will provide you with the information you need to make decisions about issues which are not routine as well.  This includes investing in equipment, pricing your products and services, choosing which products to emphasize or de-emphasize and formulating overall policies and long-range plans.\n\nWe will assist you in preparing the reports you need to satisfy investors, government authorities and other outside parties, such as long-term creditors.",
            "legacy": {
                "kind": "ZONE_COMMENT"
            },
            "rect": {
                "h": 232,
                "w": 1012,
                "x": 4,
                "y": 36
