        {
            "behavior": "none",
            "id": "n970-3",
            "kind": "comment",
            "label": "The reason we accumulate large amounts of data is to help you make decisions.  There is no way to do management without an appreciation for and an understanding of the nature of accounting.\n\nThe accounting rules built into ViewTouch will complement your knowledge and enable you to make decisions better because they will be based on the facts collected by your business.  These facts will reflect the effects of the decisions you make, right and wrong, and show you the way to correct mistakes and to continue to carry out the policies which can be shown by the facts to be the correct ones for your business.",
